I'd consider the rest of what I found in the bones.  If you're
still near the top, you can pretty much distinguish between
someone who's on the way up, and someone who got killed
naturally at that level.  If the bones seemed from a more or
less beginner, I'd probably take the risk of ?EoW.  Provided I
didn't have any means of identifying first, and probably not if
I had a scroll of remove curse or a couple of holy water.

